<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch state sets tap price of 100.85 for 2007 bond.</title>
<headline>Dutch state sets tap price of 100.85 for 2007 bond.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry on Tuesday set an opening price of 100.85 on the second day of tap sales of the government's new 5.75 percent bond due February 2007.</p>
<p>Tap sales will continue daily from 0800 GMT until further notice. The closing price on Monday was 101.00.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
